    Pads tensor.

    Padding size:
        The padding size by which to pad some dimensions of :attr:`input`
        are described starting from the last dimension and moving forward.
        :math:`\left\lfloor\frac{\text{len(pad)}}{2}\right\rfloor` dimensions
